  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the data structure. I\'ve started outlining the necessary data and component requirements. I\'m thinking a unified component set with a modular structure is essential. Specifically, a mock data file, perhaps in `src/data/mockData.ts`, will contain market intelligence data for Itapetininga & Sudoeste Paulista imports/exports.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Insights**\n\nI\'m now expanding the data insights, specifically incorporating details on Peru\'s products, volumes, growth percentages, and relevant tariffs (like ACE 58). I\'ve researched global market data, including Peru\'s GDP, bilateral trade figures, and port activity in Santos/Callao, plus the strategic materials involved. I\'ve begun compiling a real products catalog, with product data.\n\n\n**Compiling Real Data**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the practical data. I\'ve compiled several NCM codes with corresponding descriptions and some import/export information, including some specific examples of products and their origin/destination. I\'m focusing on a real product catalog with NCM codes, origins, and descriptions. I\'ve also added some sample tracking records to showcase data flow.\n\n\n**Adding Logistics Insights**\n\nI\'m now integrating logistics specifics, particularly focusing on the Itapetininga-Arequipa route. I\'ve detailed a sample shipment (`LOG-ITP-789`), including agricultural implements moving via Santos. I\'ve added key data for the support chatbot, such as required documents, tracking details (road vs. sea times), currencies, tariffs, NCM codes, taxes, and relevant government fees. I\'m also highlighting Itapetininga\'s strategic logistical advantages. I\'ll also generate a single-file HTML for the web portal.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14472628466153669601"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"export interface ProductItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  category: \'minerios\' | \'agro\' | \'pesca\' | \'industria\';\\n  origin: string;\\n  destination: string;\\n  supplier: string;\\n  location: string;\\n  ncm: string;\\n  ncmDescription: string;\\n  pricePerUnit: number;\\n  unit: string;\\n  currency: \'USD\' | \'BRL\';\\n  minOrder: number;\\n  stockStatus: string;\\n  leadTimeDays: number;\\n  routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\' | \'ITP_TO_PE\';\\n  description: string;\\n  taxBenefit: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TrackingShipment {\\n  code: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  route: string;\\n  origin: string;\\n  destination: string;\\n  status: \'EM_TRANSITO\' | \'DESEMBARACO\' | \'ENTREGUE\' | \'EMBARCANDO\';\\n  statusLabel: string;\\n  progressPercent: number;\\n  carrier: string;\\n  transportMode: \'RODOVIARIO\' | \'MARITIMO\';\\n  eta: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  currentLocation: string;\\n  coordinates: { lat: number; lng: number };\\n  telemetry: {\\n    temperature?: string;\\n    speed?: string;\\n    lastCheckpoint: string;\\n  };\\n  events: {\\n    date: string;\\n    time: string;\\n    location: string;\\n    description: string;\\n    completed: boolean;\\n  }[];\\n}\\n\\nexport const PRODUCTS_CATALOG: ProductItem[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-1\',\\n    name: \'Ferro & Insumos Minerais Concentrados\',\\n    category: \'minerios\',\\n    origin: \'San Juan de Marcona, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    supplier: \'Shougang Hierro Per\303\272 S.A.A.\',\\n    location: \'Ica / Porto de San Nicol\303\241s, Peru\',\\n    ncm: \'7201.10.00\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Ferro fundido bruto n\303\243o ligado, com teor de f\303\263sforo \342\211\244 0,5% em peso\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 850,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 25,\\n    stockStatus: \'Dispon\303\255vel em lote para embarque imediato\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 16,\\n    routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\',\\n    description: \'Min\303\251rio de ferro de alta pureza (Fe 66.5%), granulometria controlada para aciarias e fundi\303\247\303\265es do interior paulista.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Acordo ACE 58: Isen\303\247\303\243o de I.I. (0%)\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-2\',\\n    name: \'Cobre Eletrol\303\255tico (Catodos Grau A)\',\\n    category: \'minerios\',\\n    origin: \'Arequipa / Moquegua, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    supplier: \'Southern Copper Corp / Cerro Verde\',\\n    location: \'Porto de Ilo / Callao, Peru\',\\n    ncm: \'7403.11.00\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Cobre refinado em forma de catodos e se\303\247\303\265es de catodos (Pureza 99,99%)\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 9150,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 10,\\n    stockStatus: \'Contratos spot e futuros homologados\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 14,\\n    routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\',\\n    description: \'Catodos de cobre de alt\303\255ssima condutividade el\303\251trica certificados pela LME para ind\303\272strias condutoras e energia.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Acordo ACE 58: Tarifa Preferencial Mercosul-Peru\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-3\',\\n    name: \'Alho Roxo Peruano Selecionado (Calibre Extra)\',\\n    category: \'agro\',\\n    origin: \'Arequipa, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    supplier: \'Agr\303\255cola Don Ricardo SAC\',\\n    location: \'Vale do Rio Chili, Arequipa, Peru\',\\n    ncm: \'0703.20.90\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Alho fresco ou refrigerado, outros (Roxo / Ajo Morado)\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 1820,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 15,\\n    stockStatus: \'Safra nova com inspe\303\247\303\243o fitossanit\303\241ria SENASA/MAPA\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 11,\\n    routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\',\\n    description: \'Alho roxo nobre de grande durabilidade p\303\263s-colheita, ideal para entrepostos e distribuidoras do Sudoeste Paulista.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Certificado Fitossanit\303\241rio Integrado MAPA-SENASA\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-4\',\\n    name: \'Farinha de Peixe Premium (Prote\303\255na 68%)\',\\n    category: \'pesca\',\\n    origin: \'Chimbote, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    supplier: \'Pesquera Exalmar / TASA\',\\n    location: \'Porto de Callao / Chimbote, Peru\',\\n    ncm: \'2301.20.10\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Farinhas e pellets de peixe, pr\303\263prios para alimenta\303\247\303\243o de animais\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 1480,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 20,\\n    stockStatus: \'Pronta entrega com laudo bromatol\303\263gico\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 18,\\n    routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\',\\n    description: \'Insumo de alt\303\255ssimo teor proteico e digestibilidade para f\303\241bricas de ra\303\247\303\243o e nutri\303\247\303\243o animal no Sudoeste Paulista.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Certificado de Origem Digital ACE 58\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-5\',\\n    name: \'Fibras e Fios Nobres de Alpaca\',\\n    category: \'industria\',\\n    origin: \'Arequipa / Cusco, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    supplier: \'Michell y C\303\255a S.A.\',\\n    location: \'Arequipa, Peru\',\\n    ncm: \'5102.19.00\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Pelos finos de alpaca ou lhama, n\303\243o cardados nem penteados\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 24500,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 2,\\n    stockStatus: \'Estoque regular sob encomenda\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 20,\\n    routeType: \'PE_TO_ITP\',\\n    description: \'Fibras de l\303\243 natural super macias e t\303\251rmicas para a ind\303\272stria t\303\252xtil e de confec\303\247\303\265es regional.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Benef\303\255cio tarif\303\241rio bilateral\'\\n  },\\n  // Rota Inversa: De Itapetininga/SP para Peru\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-6\',\\n    name: \'Milho em Gr\303\243o & Soja Especial (N\303\243o-OGM)\',\\n    category: \'agro\',\\n    origin: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    destination: \'Lima / Callao, Peru\',\\n    supplier: \'Cooperativa Agr\303\255cola do Sudoeste Paulista\',\\n    location: \'Terminal Ferrovi\303\241rio / Armaz\303\251ns de Itapetininga-SP\',\\n    ncm: \'1005.90.10\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Milho em gr\303\243o, exceto para semeadura\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 285,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 50,\\n    stockStatus: \'Volume garantido safra 2026\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 15,\\n    routeType: \'ITP_TO_PE\',\\n    description: \'Gr\303\243os padronizados com alta energia metaboliz\303\241vel produzidos na bacia produtiva de Itapetininga para a ind\303\272stria av\303\255cola peruana.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Desonera\303\247\303\243o de PIS/COFINS na Exporta\303\247\303\243o\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-7\',\\n    name: \'M\303\241quinas & Implementos Agr\303\255colas de Precis\303\243o\',\\n    category: \'industria\',\\n    origin: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    destination: \'Trujillo / Arequipa, Peru\',\\n    supplier: \'Ind\303\272strias Metal-Mec\303\242nicas do Sudoeste Paulista\',\\n    location: \'Distrito Industrial de Itapetininga-SP\',\\n    ncm: \'8433.59.90\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'M\303\241quinas e aparelhos para colheita agr\303\255cola e debulha\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 34500,\\n    unit: \'unidade\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 1,\\n    stockStatus: \'Fabrica\303\247\303\243o sob demanda com garantia de pe\303\247as\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 22,\\n    routeType: \'ITP_TO_PE\',\\n    description: \'Equipamentos robustos desenvolvidos para agricultura tropical e adaptados para o relevo andino e costeiro do Peru.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Acordo ACE 58 com certificado Siscomex\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'prod-8\',\\n    name: \'Embalagens Biodegrad\303\241veis & Papel Cart\303\243o\',\\n    category: \'industria\',\\n    origin: \'Itapetininga, SP - Brasil\',\\n    destination: \'Lima, Peru\',\\n    supplier: \'Polo Papeleiro & Celulose do Sudoeste Paulista\',\\n    location: \'Itapetininga / Angatuba-SP\',\\n    ncm: \'4819.10.00\',\\n    ncmDescription: \'Caixas de papel ou cart\303\243o, ondulados\',\\n    pricePerUnit: 980,\\n    unit: \'tonelada\',\\n    currency: \'USD\',\\n    minOrder: 10,\\n    stockStatus: \'Em estoque pronto para exporta\303\247\303\243o\',\\n    leadTimeDays: 14,\\n    routeType: \'ITP_TO_PE\',\\n    description: \'Caixas de alta resist\303\252ncia \303\240 umidade para transporte seguro de frutas e hortali\303\247as no mercado andino.\',\\n    taxBenefit: \'Tarifa zero Mercosul-Comunidade Andina\'\\n  }\\n];\\n\\nexport const NCM_DATABASE = [\\n  { code: \'7200.00.00\', name: \'Ferro fundido, ferro e a\303\247o (Cap\303\255tulo Geral)\', ii: \'0% a 12%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'7201.10.00\', name: \'Ferro fundido bruto n\303\243o ligado (\342\211\2440,5% P)\', ii: \'0%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'7403.11.00\', name: \'Cobre refinado: Catodos e se\303\247\303\265es de catodos\', ii: \'0%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'0703.20.90\', name: \'Alhos frescos ou refrigerados (Roxo/Ajo Morado)\', ii: \'10%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'2301.20.10\', name: \'Farinhas e pellets de peixe p/ ra\303\247\303\243o animal\', ii: \'6%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'2601.11.00\', name: \'Min\303\251rios de ferro n\303\243o aglomerados e concentrados\', ii: \'0%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'1005.90.10\', name: \'Milho em gr\303\243o, exceto para semeadura\', ii: \'8%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'1201.90.00\', name: \'Soja, mesmo triturada, exceto para semeadura\', ii: \'8%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'8433.59.90\', name: \'M\303\241quinas e implementos de colheita agr\303\255cola\', ii: \'14%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento ACE 58)\' },\\n  { code: \'4819.10.00\', name: \'Caixas e cartonagens de papel ondulado\', ii: \'10%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' },\\n  { code: \'5102.19.00\', name: \'Pelos finos de alpaca ou lhama n\303\243o cardados\', ii: \'4%\', ipi: \'0%\', ace58: \'0% (Isento)\' }\\n];\\n\\nexport const TRACKING_RECORDS: Record<string, TrackingShipment> = {\\n  \'BRAPEX2026\': {\\n    code: \'BRAPEX2026\',\\n    title: \'Carga de Cobre Eletrol\303\255tico (Catodos Grau A)\',\\n    route: \'Porto de Callao (Peru) \342\236\224 Itapetininga (SP)\',\\n    origin: \'Terminal Portu\303\241rio DP World - Callao, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Polo Industrial de Cobre e Condutores - Itapetininga, SP\',\\n    status: \'EM_TRANSITO\',\\n    statusLabel: \'Em Tr\303\242nsito Alfandeg\303\241rio no Porto de Santos\',\\n    progressPercent: 78,\\n    carrier: \'Brapex Intermodal & Transoceanic Logistics\',\\n    transportMode: \'MARITIMO\',\\n    eta: \'16/11/2026 (Previs\303\243o de Desova e Entrega)\',\\n    updatedAt: \'H\303\241 18 minutos\',\\n    currentLocation: \'Canal de Santos / P\303\241tio Alfandegado BTP, SP\',\\n    coordinates: { lat: -23.9618, lng: -46.3322 },\\n    telemetry: {\\n      temperature: \'23.4\302\260C (Normal)\',\\n      speed: \'14 n\303\263s (Atracado p/ Despacho)\',\\n      lastCheckpoint: \'Vistoria RFB / Libera\303\247\303\243o Canal Verde Siscomex\'\\n    },\\n    events: [\\n      { date: \'12/11/2026\', time: \'08:45\', location: \'Santos, SP\', description: \'Atraca\303\247\303\243o e registro de Declara\303\247\303\243o de Importa\303\247\303\243o (DI)\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'08/11/2026\', time: \'14:20\', location: \'Oceano Atl\303\242ntico / Costa Sul\', description: \'Em tr\303\242nsito de navega\303\247\303\243o costeira internacional\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'02/11/2026\', time: \'19:10\', location: \'Porto de Callao, Peru\', description: \'Embarque em navio porta-cont\303\252ineres e emiss\303\243o de Bill of Lading\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'30/10/2026\', time: \'10:00\', location: \'Cerro Verde / Arequipa, Peru\', description: \'Coleta de carga e inspe\303\247\303\243o de conformidade t\303\251cnica\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'16/11/2026\', time: \'16:00\', location: \'Itapetininga, SP\', description: \'Entrega final agendada no Centro de Distribui\303\247\303\243o\', completed: false }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \'BR-PE-001\': {\\n    code: \'BR-PE-001\',\\n    title: \'Lote de Alho Roxo Peruano Selecionado (Safra Especial)\',\\n    route: \'Arequipa (Peru) \342\236\224 Entreposto Hortifr\303\272ti Itapetininga (SP)\',\\n    origin: \'Agr\303\255cola Don Ricardo - Arequipa, Peru\',\\n    destination: \'Entreposto Regional de Distribui\303\247\303\243o - Itapetininga, SP\',\\n    status: \'DESEMBARACO\',\\n    statusLabel: \'Desembara\303\247o Conclu\303\255do / Em Viagem Rodovi\303\241ria\',\\n    progressPercent: 62,\\n    carrier: \'Expresso Bioce\303\242nico dos Andes\',\\n    transportMode: \'RODOVIARIO\',\\n    eta: \'15/11/2026 (Pontual)\',\\n    updatedAt: \'H\303\241 45 minutos\',\\n    currentLocation: \'Posto Fiscal Aduaneiro / Foz do Igua\303\247u - Rodovia BR-277\',\\n    coordinates: { lat: -25.5163, lng: -54.5854 },\\n    telemetry: {\\n      temperature: \'3.8\302\260C (C\303\242mara Fria Ativa)\',\\n      speed: \'76 km/h\',\\n      lastCheckpoint: \'Inspe\303\247\303\243o Fitossanit\303\241ria MAPA Vigiagro - Aprovado\'\\n    },\\n    events: [\\n      { date: \'12/11/2026\', time: \'05:30\', location: \'Foz do Igua\303\247u, PR\', description: \'Libera\303\247\303\243o aduaneira Vigiagro e sa\303\255da em comboio refrigerado\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'10/11/2026\', time: \'16:40\', location: \'Corumb\303\241 / Fronteira Brasil-Bol\303\255via\', description: \'Passagem fronteiri\303\247a pelo Corredor Bioce\303\242nico\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'06/11/2026\', time: \'09:00\', location: \'Arequipa, Peru\', description: \'Carregamento com term\303\263grafo certificado e lacre aduaneiro\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'15/11/2026\', time: \'11:00\', location: \'Itapetininga, SP\', description: \'Descarregamento na c\303\242mara fria de Itapetininga\', completed: false }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \'LOG-ITP-789\': {\\n    code: \'LOG-ITP-789\',\\n    title: \'Implementos e M\303\241quinas Agr\303\255colas para Trujillo (Peru)\',\\n    route: \'Itapetininga (SP) \342\236\224 Trujillo / Lima (Peru)\',\\n    origin: \'Distrito Industrial de Itapetininga, SP\',\\n    destination: \'Valle Chicama - Trujillo, Peru\',\\n    status: \'EMBARCANDO\',\\n    statusLabel: \'Confer\303\252ncia F\303\255sica e Estufagem em Cont\303\252iner Flat Rack\',\\n    progressPercent: 35,\\n    carrier: \'Brapex Multimodal Paulista\',\\n    transportMode: \'MARITIMO\',\\n    eta: \'24/11/2026\',\\n    updatedAt: \'H\303\241 2 horas\',\\n    currentLocation: \'Terminal Retroportu\303\241rio de Santos / P\303\241tio Cubat\303\243o\',\\n    coordinates: { lat: -23.8824, lng: -46.4253 },\\n    telemetry: {\\n      temperature: \'25.0\302\260C (Carga Seca Maquin\303\241rio)\',\\n      speed: \'0 km/h (P\303\241tio Aduaneiro)\',\\n      lastCheckpoint: \'Vistoria de Amarra\303\247\303\243o de Carga Pesada\'\\n    },\\n    events: [\\n      { date: \'11/11/2026\', time: \'17:00\', location: \'Itapetininga, SP\', description: \'Emiss\303\243o de DU-E (Declara\303\247\303\243o \303\232nica de Exporta\303\247\303\243o) no Siscomex\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'12/11/2026\', time: \'07:20\', location: \'Santos, SP\', description: \'Entrada no recinto alfandegado e confer\303\252ncia documental\', completed: true },\\n      { date: \'14/11/2026\', time: \'18:00\', location: \'Porto de Santos, SP\', description: \'Carregamento programado em navio com destino a Callao\', completed: false },\\n      { date: \'24/11/2026\', time: \'14:00\', location: \'Trujillo, Peru\', description: \'Entrega final ao comprador peruano\', completed: false }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n};\\n\\nexport const CHATBOT_KNOWLEDGE = [\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'documento\', \'documentos\', \'invoice\', \'certificado\', \'origem\', \'qualidade\'],\\n    response: \'Para exportar ou importar via Brapex s\303\243o exigidos 3 documentos principais: 1) Invoice Comercial (Fatura Proforma com NCM e Incoterm); 2) Certificado de Origem Digital ACE 58 (garante isen\303\247\303\243o de imposto entre Brasil e Peru); 3) Certificado de Qualidade/Fitossanit\303\241rio (MAPA para alimentos e gr\303\243os, ou SENASA no Peru). Todos podem ser anexados diretamente no nosso fluxo documental.\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'ncm\', \'classificacao\', \'fiscal\', \'codigo\', \'aliquota\'],\\n    response: \'O c\303\263digo NCM (Nomenclatura Comum do Mercosul) classifica a mercadoria para fins aduaneiros e fiscais. Gra\303\247as ao Acordo de Complementa\303\247\303\243o Econ\303\264mica ACE 58 entre Brasil e Peru, mais de 98% dos produtos possuem al\303\255quota 0% de Imposto de Importa\303\247\303\243o! Voc\303\252 pode consultar qualquer NCM na ferramenta \\\"Consulta NCM\\\" no menu acima.\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'rastreio\', \'rastreamento\', \'onde esta\', \'codigo\', \'brapex2026\', \'prazo\', \'tempo\'],\\n    response: \'Voc\303\252 pode rastrear qualquer carga digitando o c\303\263digo na aba \\\"Rastreamento\\\". Experimente testar com BRAPEX2026 (Cobre no Porto de Santos) ou BR-PE-001 (Alho Peruano no Corredor Bioce\303\242nico). Nossos prazos m\303\251dios s\303\243o: 10 a 14 dias para o modal Rodovi\303\241rio Transoce\303\242nico e 18 a 22 dias para o modal Mar\303\255timo Santos-Callao.\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'moeda\', \'cambio\', \'sol\', \'peruano\', \'real\', \'cotacao\', \'dolar\'],\\n    response: \'Nossa taxa de refer\303\252ncia do Sol Peruano (PEN) em rela\303\247\303\243o ao Real (BRL) \303\251 de 1 BRL = 0,68 PEN (ou 1 PEN \342\211\210 1,47 BRL). No nosso Conversor de Moedas, voc\303\252 pode simular a troca instant\303\242nea com o c\303\241lculo do IOF aduaneiro de 0,38% e taxa de c\303\242mbio interbanc\303\241ria PTAX.\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'taxa\', \'pagamento\', \'pix\', \'245\', \'gov.br\', \'emolumentos\', \'custo\'],\\n    response: \'As taxas governamentais padr\303\243o para o tr\303\242mite aduaneiro simplificado s\303\243o: Taxa de Exporta\303\247\303\243o (R$ 180,00), Emolumentos GOV (R$ 45,00) e Taxa de Servi\303\247o Siscomex (R$ 20,00), totalizando R$ 245,00. O pagamento pode ser feito via Pix instant\303\242neo, QR Code ou GRU/Boleto Banc\303\241rio diretamente pelo portal.\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    keywords: [\'itapetininga\', \'sudoeste\', \'paulista\', \'porto\', \'santos\'],\\n    response: \'Itapetininga \303\251 o polo estrat\303\251gico do Sudoeste Paulista, com liga\303\247\303\243o direta pelas rodovias Raposo Tavares e Castelo Branco at\303\251 o Porto de Santos, al\303\251m de conex\303\243o com o Corredor Bioce\303\242nico rumo ao Peru. A Brapex oferece um entreposto aduaneiro dedicado na regi\303\243o para facilitar a log\303\255stica de pequenos e grandes produtores.\'\\n  }\\n];\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create mock data module with products, NCM database, tracking shipments, and chatbot knowledge\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/data/mockData.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing mock data module\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write mock data for Brapex portal\"}"
