  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Navigation Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building the `HeaderNav.tsx` component, adhering to the Top Bar Contract. I\'ve defined Zone 1 with the \"BRAPEX\" wordmark and subtitle. Zone 2 is populated with the navigation links \"Opera\303\247\303\265es\" and \"Produtos &\".\n\n\n**Defining Dashboard View**\n\nI\'m now detailing the structure of the `DashboardView.tsx` component. I\'ve designed a \"Ol\303\241, Larissa!\" banner, including the operator badge and quick indicators. Additionally, I\'m working on \"Cards de Destaque.\" I\'m prioritizing the user experience and ensuring clear and concise information delivery.\n\n\n**Elaborating Product Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Intelig\303\252ncia Comercial\" section, including imported/exported products between Itapetininga/Sudoeste Paulista and Peru, with tabs for volume, growth, and economic significance. Next, I\'m integrating data on the Peruvian economy, like GDP and trade volume, in \"Radar de Mercado Mundial.\" I\'m also planning the currency converter, and its interactive features.\n\n\n**Detailing Product Flows**\n\nI\'m now detailing product flows, initially focusing on \"Peru -> Itapetininga\" and \"Itapetininga -> Peru.\" I\'ve incorporated category filters for precise data retrieval and constructed product cards with relevant pricing and descriptions. Each card will provide a clear path to generating a quotation or exporting directly via a dedicated button, leading to the document workflow. I\'m prioritizing providing data for immediate use to the user.\n\n\n**Finalizing Transaction Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the final transaction elements. I\'ve designed sections for document attachments, including an \"Anexar arquivo\" button with file picker simulation, progress bar, and visual feedback for each attachment type. Finally, I\'m integrating a \"IR PARA PAGAMENTO (GOV.BR)\" button with validation for instant checkout.\n\n\n**Developing Logistics Tracking**\n\nI\'m now detailing logistics tracking within the application. I\'ve designed a search bar for tracking codes with quick button examples. I\'m also including a real-time status card for shipment details, and I\'m focusing on an interactive route map of South America, with an animated route visualization. Furthermore, I\'m working on a timeline of checkpoints, and will also provide a searchable NCM table and freight simulator.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16429277715646054966"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { \\n  Ship, \\n  HelpCircle, \\n  PhoneCall, \\n  LogOut, \\n  UserCheck, \\n  Compass, \\n  TrendingUp, \\n  FileText, \\n  Truck, \\n  Search, \\n  DollarSign, \\n  Calculator,\\n  Download\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderNavProps {\\n  activeTab: string;\\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void;\\n  isLoggedIn: boolean;\\n  userName: string;\\n  onLoginClick: () => void;\\n  onLogoutClick: () => void;\\n  onOpenHelp: () => void;\\n  onOpenContact: () => void;\\n  onOpenExportHtml: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const HeaderNav: React.FC<HeaderNavProps> = ({\\n  activeTab,\\n  setActiveTab,\\n  isLoggedIn,\\n  userName,\\n  onLoginClick,\\n  onLogoutClick,\\n  onOpenHelp,\\n  onOpenContact,\\n  onOpenExportHtml\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-[#1A3026] text-[#F9F8F6] border-b border-[#254436] shadow-sm\\\">\\n      {/* Top Bar Contract: Zone 1 (Brand) - Zone 2 (Nav Links) - Zone 3 (Action) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-8\\\">\\n        \\n        {/* Zone 1: Single element wordmark */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button \\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(isLoggedIn ? \'dashboard\' : \'login\')}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-left focus:outline-none group\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Brapex - Ir para o In\303\255cio\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#2E5A44] border border-[#3E7559] flex items-center justify-center text-[#F9F8F6] shadow-inner group-hover:bg-[#386b51] transition-colors\\\">\\n              <Ship className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-[#F9F8F6]\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-wider text-[#F9F8F6] leading-none\\\">\\n                BRAPEX\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[#B5C9BD] uppercase font-medium mt-0.5\\\">\\n                Importa\303\247\303\265es & Exporta\303\247\303\265es\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: 4-5 clean single-line nav links */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 xl:gap-2\\\">\\n          {isLoggedIn ? (\\n            <>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'dashboard\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                  activeTab === \'dashboard\'\\n                    ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <Compass className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                Painel Geral\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'products\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                  activeTab === \'products\'\\n                    ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <TrendingUp className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                Cota\303\247\303\265es & Produtos\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'workflow\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                  activeTab === \'workflow\'\\n                    ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <FileText className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                Documenta\303\247\303\243o\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'payment\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                  activeTab === \'payment\'\\n                    ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <DollarSign className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                Pagamento Gov.br\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'tracking\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                  activeTab === \'tracking\'\\n                    ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <Truck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                Rastreamento\\n              </button>\\n            </>\\n          ) : (\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-[#B5C9BD]\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden xl:inline\\\">Sudoeste Paulista \342\236\224 Peru & Mercado Global</span>\\n              <span>\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Siscomex Integrado</span>\\n              <span>\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Corredor Bioce\303\242nico</span>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Primary Action & Utilities */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          {/* Quick Tools */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenExportHtml}\\n            title=\\\"Baixar ou ver vers\303\243o em arquivo \303\272nico HTML\\\"\\n            className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31] rounded-md transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden xl:inline\\\">Arquivo \303\232nico</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenHelp}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31] rounded-md transition-colors\\\"\\n            title=\\\"D\303\272vidas e Suporte\\\"\\n          >\\n            <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Ajuda</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenContact}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31] rounded-md transition-colors\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Contatos e Endere\303\247o\\\"\\n          >\\n            <PhoneCall className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Contato</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-[#2E5A44] mx-1\\\" />\\n\\n          {isLoggedIn ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#223F31] border border-[#2E5A44] py-1 px-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"font-medium text-white\\\">{userName}</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={onLogoutClick}\\n                className=\\\"p-1.5 text-[#C5D5CC] hover:text-white hover:bg-[#223F31] rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n                title=\\\"Sair da Sess\303\243o\\\"\\n              >\\n                <LogOut className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onLoginClick}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#1351B4] hover:bg-[#0c3e8e] rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <UserCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Entrar com Gov.br</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Navigation bar for logged in users */}\\n      {isLoggedIn && (\\n        <div className=\\\"lg:hidden border-t border-[#254436] bg-[#14261E] px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-1 overflow-x-auto text-xs\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'dashboard\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              activeTab === \'dashboard\' ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white\' : \'text-[#A8BEB1]\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Painel\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'products\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              activeTab === \'products\' ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white\' : \'text-[#A8BEB1]\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Cota\303\247\303\265es\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'workflow\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              activeTab === \'workflow\' ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white\' : \'text-[#A8BEB1]\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Documenta\303\247\303\243o\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'payment\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              activeTab === \'payment\' ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white\' : \'text-[#A8BEB1]\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Pagamento\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'tracking\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              activeTab === \'tracking\' ? \'bg-[#28493A] text-white\' : \'text-[#A8BEB1]\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Rastreamento\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create HeaderNav component with 3-zone Top Bar Contract\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/HeaderNav.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing HeaderNav component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write HeaderNav component\"}"
