  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing the UI**\n\nI\'m currently focused on replicating the provided web application\'s structure precisely. I\'m prioritizing pixel-perfect fidelity to the original HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The UI/UX aspects are paramount, so I\'m meticulously examining the code to ensure an exact visual match. I\'m working with a single file to render the exact result, like the provided code.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Interactive Screens**\n\nI\'m now focusing on ensuring all ten screens are fully interactive and navigable, starting with the login and dashboard. I\'m prioritizing the user flow and replicating the exact look and feel. I\'m working to recreate the \"Ol\303\241, Larissa!\" greeting, the interactive cards on the dashboard, and the grid of quick links. After this, I am aiming to replicate the intelligence business view, and the product export functionalities.\n\n\n**Implementing Payment Flows**\n\nI\'m now integrating the payment functionality, specifically the options for Pix, QR Code, and Boleto Banc\303\241rio. I\'m focusing on displaying the total amount, R$ 245,00, and ensuring the \"Pague com Pix\" section functions correctly with a QR code and copy button.\n\nI am also prioritizing the implementation of the simulation of freight, and the real time tracking.\n\n\n"
