  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Request**: Build and maintain the **BraPex \342\200\224 Portal de Opera\303\247\303\265es** web application matching the exact 10-screen mobile-shell HTML5/CSS3/JS layout, colors, typography, and texts provided by the user, plus requested customizations:\n  1. *(Completed in previous turn)* Make the **\"Radar de Mercado Mundial\"** card on the Dashboard navigate to `https://comexstat.mdic.gov.br/pt/home` in a new tab.\n  2. *(Current turn)* In **Tela 10 (Perfil do Usu\303\241rio)** under **\"ACESSO R\303\201PIDO\" \342\206\222 \"Alterar idioma\"**, replace the static `PT / ES` text with two buttons labeled **\"Portugu\303\252s\"** and **\"Espanhol\"** so that clicking **\"Espanhol\"** translates the entire website into Spanish and clicking **\"Portugu\303\252s\"** translates the entire website back into Portuguese.\n- **Deliverables**:\n  - React SPA (`/src/App.tsx`, `/src/translations.ts`, `/src/index.css`, `/index.html`).\n  - Standalone single-file HTML bundle (`/public/brapex_portal.html`) kept in sync with the React app.\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Completed Earlier Turns**:\n  - Built all 10 interactive screens matching the user\'s template in `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/index.css`, `/index.html`, and `/public/brapex_portal.html`:\n    1. `screen-login` (\"BRAPEX: CONECTANDO SUDOESTE PAULISTA AO FUTURO\", \"Entrar com o Gov\", \"Ajuda\", \"Contato\")\n    2. `screen-dashboard` (\"Ol\303\241, Larissa!\", \"Intelig\303\252ncia Comercial\", simulated \"Conversor de Moedas\" 1 R$ = 0,68 S/., \"Radar de Mercado Mundial\" linked to `https://comexstat.mdic.gov.br/pt/home`, 5-card shortcut grid, and tracking summary `BRP-2026-001`)\n    3. `screen-inteligencia` (\"Sua regi\303\243o em foco\", Brasil/Peru flow pills, selectable product rows)\n    4. `screen-produtos` (search, route buttons Peru \342\206\224 Itapetininga, Ferro/Insumos, Shougang Hierro Per\303\272 US$ 850/ton, SIDERPERU US$ 890/ton, Cobre, Alho Peruano, Farinha de Peixe)\n    5. `screen-docs` (Checklist + Processo de Exporta\303\247\303\243o Ferro/Insumos NCM 7200.00.00 + Invoice Comercial, Certificado de Origem, Certificado de Qualidade with dynamic counter + \"IR PARA PAGAMENTO (GOV.BR)\")\n    6. `screen-pagamento` (R$ 180 + R$ 45 + R$ 20 = R$ 245,00, Pix / QR Code / Boleto Banc\303\241rio, \"Pague com Pix\" SVG QR code, \"Copiar C\303\263digo Pix\")\n    7. `screen-frete` (Produto, Valor, Peso, Origem, Destino, \"SIMULAR\")\n    8. `screen-rastreamento` (BRAPEX2026 / BR-PE-001 / CARGA123, animated truck on Brasil \342\206\222 Peru map with \"Animar rota\", and functional Chatbot)\n    9. `screen-guia` (\"Pesquise antes de movimentar.\", \"CONSULTAR NCM\", Documentos de exporta\303\247\303\243o, Certificado de origem, Perfil do Usu\303\241rio card)\n    10. `screen-perfil` (Paula Andrades Gomes Oliveira, personal info form, Acesso R\303\241pido \342\206\222 Alterar idioma)\n  - Generated hero port image saved at `/src/assets/images/brapex_port_hero_1794492624789.jpg`.\n- **Completed in Current Turn (Unverified Build/Lint)**:\n  - Created `/src/translations.ts` exporting `Language = \'pt\' | \'es\'` and `TRANSLATIONS` covering all 10 screens, nav menu, navbar titles, chatbot messages/replies, freight calculation/validation, document checklist/upload statuses, NCM info, Pix copy feedback, and footer.\n  - Updated `/src/App.tsx` to use `lang` state (`\'pt\' | \'es\'`), bind all UI strings to `TRANSLATIONS[lang]`, sync `document.documentElement.lang`, replace `window.alert` calls with inline UI feedback (Pix copy button feedback, inline NCM info box, inline freight weight error), and add **\"Portugu\303\252s\"** and **\"Espanhol\"** toggle buttons in `screen-perfil` under `ACESSO R\303\201PIDO` \342\206\222 `Alterar idioma`.\n  - Updated `/public/brapex_portal.html` to add `btn-lang-pt` (\"Portugu\303\252s\") and `btn-lang-es` (\"Espanhol\") buttons and `setLanguage(lang)` translation logic (`I18N_MAP` + `TreeWalker`).\n- **Not Yet Completed / Remaining**:\n  - Clean up minor issues spotted in `/public/brapex_portal.html` (see Key Findings & Next Steps).\n  - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel to verify TypeScript and Vite build succeed with zero errors.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Runtime Environment**: Avoid `window.alert` / `window.open` (sandboxed iframe compatibility). External link to `https://comexstat.mdic.gov.br/pt/home` uses `<a href=\"...\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">`.\n- **Standalone HTML Translation Edge Cases (`/public/brapex_portal.html`)**:\n  - In `public/brapex_portal.html`, `TreeWalker` with `NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT` translates visible text nodes, **but** it does not translate:\n    1. `<input placeholder=\"...\">` attributes (`placeholder` on search inputs, `doc-kg`, `frete-valor`, `frete-peso`, `frete-destino`, `track-code`, `chat-msg-input`, `Nome da empresa`, etc.).\n    2. Dynamic counter text `\'0 de 3 documentos anexados\'` (when `docsAnexados === 0` or `> 0`, the full string `\'0 de 3 documentos anexados\'` isn\'t in `PT_TO_ES`).\n    3. `<button title=\"...\">` attributes in navbar.\n    4. Exact strings like `\'C\303\263digo NCM Vinculado: 7200.00.00\'` or `\'Simular Frete\'` / `\'Pa\303\255s de destino\'` \342\200\224 verify every Spanish entry in `PT_TO_ES` (also remove the duplicate key `\'Calcule o custo e a viabilidade por kg.\'` and `\'Os requisitos s\303\243o orientativos...\'` and fix typo `\'Principales mercadorias da regi\303\243o\'` in `I18N_MAP.pt`).\n  - Also check `/src/App.tsx` inputs with `defaultValue` (`Itapetininga, Brasil`, `Brasil`, `Peru`): those are user-editable inputs so `defaultValue` is fine, though `t.docsOriginDefault` / `t.docsDestDefault` (`Peru` / `Per\303\272`) won\'t update an uncontrolled input when toggling language after mount if `defaultValue` is used unless controlled or keyed \342\200\224 worth making `t.docsDestDefault` reactive or keeping clean.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No compile or runtime errors have been thrown yet in this turn because `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` have not been run since modifying `/src/translations.ts`, `/src/App.tsx`, and `/public/brapex_portal.html`.\n- Previous turn\'s `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passed cleanly (`tsc --noEmit` and `vite build`).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace root contains React + Vite + Tailwind v4 app (`/src/App.tsx`, `/src/translations.ts`, `/src/index.css`, `/index.html`, `/metadata.json`) and static assets (`/public/brapex_portal.html`, `/src/assets/images/brapex_port_hero_1794492624789.jpg`).\n- Unused leftover component files from the initial turn (`/src/data/mockData.ts`, `/src/components/*`) may still exist in `/src/`, though `/src/App.tsx` does not import them; leave them untouched unless needed since `tsc --noEmit` previously passed with them present, or verify `lint_applet` passes cleanly.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Polish `/public/brapex_portal.html` i18n completeness**:\n   - Inspect lines 875\342\200\2231180 of `/public/brapex_portal.html`.\n   - Clean up `I18N_MAP` (remove duplicate keys and the `\'Principales\'` typo in `pt`).\n   - Ensure dynamic strings like `\'0 de 3 documentos anexados\'` / `\'1 de 3...\'` / `\'2 de 3...\'` / `\'3 de 3...\'` and `<input>` `placeholder` attributes + `title` attributes also switch cleanly between Portuguese and Spanish inside `setLanguage(lang)`.\n   - Optionally replace `alert(...)` in `public/brapex_portal.html` (`copyPix`, `CONSULTAR NCM`, `calcularFrete`) with inline feedback matching `src/App.tsx`.\n2. **Verify React App (`/src/App.tsx` & `/src/translations.ts`)**:\n   - Quickly verify there are no missing translation keys or TypeScript errors (`tsc --noEmit`).\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` **together in the same turn**. Fix any issues if reported.\n3. **Final Response**:\n   - Summarize concisely in Portuguese confirming the **\"Portugu\303\252s\"** and **\"Espanhol\"** buttons in **Perfil do Usu\303\241rio \342\206\222 Acesso R\303\241pido \342\206\222 Alterar idioma** and full-site translation across all 10 screens.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Preserve exact layout, colors (`#1A3026`, `#2B4C3B`, `#F6F4EE`, `#E6ECE7`, `#FFFFFF`), typography (`Inter`, `Playfair Display`), section hierarchy, and original Portuguese copy when Portuguese is selected.\n- Two explicit buttons in Perfil do Usu\303\241rio \342\206\222 Acesso R\303\241pido \342\206\222 Alterar idioma: one labeled **\"Espanhol\"** (switches the entire site to Spanish) and one labeled **\"Portugu\303\252s\"** (switches the entire site to Portuguese).\n- Do not use `window.alert` or `window.open` in the React app.\n- Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same turn on the final build check before finishing.\n</summary>"
