  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Replicating Features**\n\nI\'m focusing on replicating the currency converter enhancements from `/public/brapex_portal.html` into a new file. Specifically, I need to integrate live BRL\342\206\224PEN rate fetching with a 0.68 fallback, implement Brazilian decimal parsing, add currency labels, and ensure the clear converted Sol Peruano result banner on click. I\'m planning to use `multi_replace_file_content` to efficiently update the target file.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14967875959541145671"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Sync standalone HTML currency converter with React app: live rate fetch with 0.68 fallback, Brazilian decimal parsing, currency labels, and clear result banner on Convert click\", \"Instruction\":\"Update the Conversor de Moedas HTML card and JavaScript logic in public/brapex_portal.html\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":442, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        <div class=\\\"card-dark\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\" style=\\\"color:#A8BDB2; margin:0;\\\">REFER\303\212NCIA CAMBIAL</span>\\n                <span id=\\\"fx-badge\\\" style=\\\"background:#FFFFFF; color:var(--primary-dark); font-size:0.65rem; font-weight:800; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px;\\\">SIMULADO</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:4px;\\\">Conversor de Moedas</h3>\\n            <p id=\\\"fx-subtitle\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0.8rem; color:#D4DFD9; margin-bottom:14px;\\\">1 R$ = 0,68 S/. \302\267 taxa de refer\303\252ncia</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr; gap:8px; align-items:end; margin-bottom:12px;\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                    <span id=\\\"fx-label-from\\\" style=\\\"display:block; font-size:0.7rem; color:#A8BDB2; margin-bottom:4px; font-weight:600;\\\">Real (R$)</span>\\n                    <input type=\\\"text\\\" inputmode=\\\"decimal\\\" id=\\\"input-brl\\\" value=\\\"100\\\" oninput=\\\"handleBrlInput()\\\" onkeydown=\\\"if(event.key===\'Enter\') converterMoeda()\\\" placeholder=\\\"0,00\\\">\\n                </div>\\n                <button type=\\\"button\\\" onclick=\\\"inverterMoeda()\\\" title=\\\"Inverter moedas\\\" style=\\\"background:#EAE7DF; border:none; border-radius:10px; padding:12px 10px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:bold; height:44px;\\\">\342\207\204</button>\\n                <div>\\n                    <span id=\\\"fx-label-to\\\" style=\\\"display:block; font-size:0.7rem; color:#A8BDB2; margin-bottom:4px; font-weight:600;\\\">Sol Peruano (S/.)</span>\\n                    <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"output-pen\\\" value=\\\"68,00 S/.\\\" readonly style=\\\"background:#F4F4F4; font-weight:700;\\\">\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"width:100%; border:none;\\\" onclick=\\\"converterMoeda()\\\">Converter</button>\\n            <div id=\\\"fx-result-box\\\" class=\\\"hidden\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:12px; background:rgba(230,236,231,0.14); border:1px solid rgba(168,189,178,0.45); font-size:0.84rem; color:#FFFFFF;\\\"></div>\\n            <p id=\\\"fx-note\\\" style=\\\"font-size:0.7rem; color:#A8BDB2; margin-top:10px;\\\">Taxa de refer\303\252ncia para demonstra\303\247\303\243o.</p>\\n        </div>\", \"StartLine\":426, \"TargetContent\":\"        <div class=\\\"card-dark\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\" style=\\\"color:#A8BDB2; margin:0;\\\">REFER\303\212NCIA CAMBIAL</span>\\n                <span style=\\\"background:#FFFFFF; color:var(--primary-dark); font-size:0.65rem; font-weight:800; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px;\\\">SIMULADO</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:4px;\\\">Conversor de Moedas</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"font-size:0.8rem; color:#D4DFD9; margin-bottom:14px;\\\">1 R$ = 0,68 S/. \302\267 taxa simulada de refer\303\252ncia</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:12px;\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"input-brl\\\" value=\\\"100\\\" oninput=\\\"converterMoeda()\\\" placeholder=\\\"0,00\\\">\\n                <button onclick=\\\"inverterMoeda()\\\" style=\\\"background:#EAE7DF; border:none; border-radius:10px; padding:10px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:bold;\\\">\342\207\204</button>\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"output-pen\\\" value=\\\"68,00 S/.\\\" readonly style=\\\"background:#F4F4F4;\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"width:100%; border:none;\\\" onclick=\\\"converterMoeda()\\\">Converter</button>\\n            <p style=\\\"font-size:0.7rem; color:#A8BDB2; margin-top:10px;\\\">Taxa simulada para demonstra\303\247\303\243o.</p>\\n        </div>\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1150, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    let fxRate = 0.68;\\n    let fxIsLive = false;\\n\\n    function parseCurrencyAmount(raw) {\\n        const cleaned = String(raw || \'\').trim().replace(/[^\\\\d.,]/g, \'\');\\n        if (!cleaned) return 0;\\n        if (cleaned.includes(\',\') && cleaned.includes(\'.\')) {\\n            if (cleaned.lastIndexOf(\',\') > cleaned.lastIndexOf(\'.\')) {\\n                return parseFloat(cleaned.replace(/\\\\./g, \'\').replace(\',\', \'.\')) || 0;\\n            }\\n            return parseFloat(cleaned.replace(/,/g, \'\')) || 0;\\n        }\\n        if (cleaned.includes(\',\')) {\\n            return parseFloat(cleaned.replace(\',\', \'.\')) || 0;\\n        }\\n        return parseFloat(cleaned) || 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    function formatBrNumber(num, decimals) {\\n        const d = typeof decimals === \'number\' ? decimals : 2;\\n        return num.toLocaleString(\'pt-BR\', { minimumFractionDigits: d, maximumFractionDigits: d });\\n    }\\n\\n    function formatFxOutput(val) {\\n        return brlParaPen ? formatBrNumber(val * fxRate, 2) + \' S/.\' : \'R$ \' + formatBrNumber(val / fxRate, 2);\\n    }\\n\\n    function updateFxTexts() {\\n        const badge = document.getElementById(\'fx-badge\');\\n        const sub = document.getElementById(\'fx-subtitle\');\\n        const fromLbl = document.getElementById(\'fx-label-from\');\\n        const toLbl = document.getElementById(\'fx-label-to\');\\n        const note = document.getElementById(\'fx-note\');\\n        const dec = fxIsLive ? 4 : 2;\\n        if (badge) {\\n            badge.innerText = fxIsLive ? (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'ACTUALIZADO\' : \'ATUALIZADO\') : \'SIMULADO\';\\n        }\\n        if (sub) {\\n            const pair = brlParaPen\\n                ? \'1 R$ = \' + formatBrNumber(fxRate, dec) + \' S/.\'\\n                : \'1 S/. = R$ \' + formatBrNumber(1 / fxRate, dec);\\n            const desc = fxIsLive\\n                ? (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'cotizaci\303\263n de mercado\' : \'cota\303\247\303\243o de mercado\')\\n                : (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'tasa de referencia\' : \'taxa de refer\303\252ncia\');\\n            sub.innerText = pair + \' \302\267 \' + desc;\\n        }\\n        if (fromLbl && toLbl) {\\n            fromLbl.innerText = brlParaPen ? \'Real (R$)\' : \'Sol Peruano (S/.)\';\\n            toLbl.innerText = brlParaPen ? \'Sol Peruano (S/.)\' : \'Real (R$)\';\\n        }\\n        if (note) {\\n            note.innerText = fxIsLive\\n                ? (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'Cotizaci\303\263n actualizada en tiempo real (BRL \342\206\224 PEN).\' : \'Cota\303\247\303\243o atualizada em tempo real (BRL \342\206\224 PEN).\')\\n                : (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'Tasa de referencia para demostraci\303\263n.\' : \'Taxa de refer\303\252ncia para demonstra\303\247\303\243o.\');\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    function handleBrlInput() {\\n        const val = parseCurrencyAmount(document.getElementById(\'input-brl\').value);\\n        document.getElementById(\'output-pen\').value = formatFxOutput(val);\\n        const box = document.getElementById(\'fx-result-box\');\\n        if (box && !box.classList.contains(\'hidden\')) {\\n            converterMoeda();\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    function converterMoeda() {\\n        const val = parseCurrencyAmount(document.getElementById(\'input-brl\').value);\\n        const box = document.getElementById(\'fx-result-box\');\\n        if (val <= 0) {\\n            document.getElementById(\'output-pen\').value = brlParaPen ? \'0,00 S/.\' : \'R$ 0,00\';\\n            if (box) {\\n                box.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\\n                box.style.background = \'rgba(253,240,230,0.14)\';\\n                box.style.borderColor = \'rgba(255,190,140,0.45)\';\\n                box.innerHTML = \'<span style=\\\"color:#FFD8B8; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:600;\\\">\' +\\n                    (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'Ingrese un monto mayor que cero para convertir.\' : \'Informe um valor maior que zero para converter.\') +\\n                    \'</span>\';\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        const out = formatFxOutput(val);\\n        document.getElementById(\'output-pen\').value = out;\\n        if (box) {\\n            const fromText = brlParaPen ? \'R$ \' + formatBrNumber(val, 2) : \'S/. \' + formatBrNumber(val, 2);\\n            const label = brlParaPen\\n                ? (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'Convertido a Sol Peruano:\' : \'Convertido para Sol Peruano:\')\\n                : (currentLang === \'es\' ? \'Convertido a Real:\' : \'Convertido para Real:\');\\n            box.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\\n            box.style.background = \'rgba(230,236,231,0.14)\';\\n            box.style.borderColor = \'rgba(168,189,178,0.45)\';\\n            box.innerHTML = \'<div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;\\\">\' +\\n                \'<span style=\\\"color:#D4DFD9; font-size:0.76rem;\\\">\' + label + \'</span>\' +\\n                \'<strong style=\\\"font-size:0.96rem; color:#FFFFFF;\\\">\' + fromText + \' = \' + out + \'</strong></div>\';\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    function inverterMoeda() {\\n        brlParaPen = !brlParaPen;\\n        updateFxTexts();\\n        const val = parseCurrencyAmount(document.getElementById(\'input-brl\').value);\\n        document.getElementById(\'output-pen\').value = formatFxOutput(val);\\n        const box = document.getElementById(\'fx-result-box\');\\n        if (box && !box.classList.contains(\'hidden\')) {\\n            converterMoeda();\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    (function loadLiveFxRate() {\\n        fetch(\'https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/BRL\')\\n            .then(r => r.ok ? r.json() : null)\\n            .then(d => {\\n                const pen = Number(d && d.rates && d.rates.PEN);\\n                if (Number.isFinite(pen) && pen > 0) {\\n                    fxRate = pen;\\n                    fxIsLive = true;\\n                    updateFxTexts();\\n                    handleBrlInput();\\n                    return true;\\n                }\\n                return false;\\n            })\\n            .catch(() => false)\\n            .then(ok => {\\n                if (ok) return;\\n                return fetch(\'https://economia.awesomeapi.com.br/json/last/BRL-PEN\')\\n                    .then(r => r.ok ? r.json() : null)\\n                    .then(d => {\\n                        const pen2 = Number(d && d.BRLPEN && d.BRLPEN.bid);\\n                        if (Number.isFinite(pen2) && pen2 > 0) {\\n                            fxRate = pen2;\\n                            fxIsLive = true;\\n                            updateFxTexts();\\n                            handleBrlInput();\\n                        }\\n                    })\\n                    .catch(() => {});\\n            });\\n    })();\", \"StartLine\":1139, \"TargetContent\":\"    function converterMoeda() {\\n        const val = parseFloat(document.getElementById(\'input-brl\').value) || 0;\\n        const result = brlParaPen ? (val * 0.68).toFixed(2) + \' S/.\' : \'R$ \' + (val / 0.68).toFixed(2);\\n        document.getElementById(\'output-pen\').value = result.replace(\'.\', \',\');\\n    }\\n\\n    function inverterMoeda() {\\n        brlParaPen = !brlParaPen;\\n        converterMoeda();\\n    }\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/public/brapex_portal.html\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating standalone HTML currency converter\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update standalone HTML currency converter\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\342\003\n\337\003\001i\024}\023I\217\316]\204C\245\027\363,\253\263\354z\232\"hMh\222\242\322\ag\033\221\341\362\341]\tzP\2614p\vbk\324\311\344\\\357P\325\272\036\351wn\334\336Nkh_i\b\371\236\265\345\203p\277\207\230\335@3\f\177\247$H\356\v\370\353\305p_\035\002^\235\253\225\260\264v\313\3463]-eK\350\252\217\031w\207\210+< \272\341\215\212+\264FX\001\360q3\344\351\204\276\251i\320\025(\001\224\205\266\350\212\320\'\001\202\262\363\242\n\371 \354\220yW\2138\251\201z\0002\236\nq\361\2276dc\231k\261o\223\263\321\371\244w_\223\255\353\222\255\f\217\025d\371Ea\331_\027\337\267\262\235FBt\030\017\337~X\275\320\346)2j\377\001\352\341+\t\230~\336P\035\220\224\005h\022d\266\240\2778\360\"\330\033w`\177kE\375\274\266\026!\025\316W,\223\366\331\365\357\026\250m\325\v\273x\212\030\354\354\342!\247\211$\270$\330\247\037\240\236\277\2438\246!\270Y\021\304:\023m\247\202\352\260j\302\362(\023\344\363.:\203\201\245\324\276\025\302m\351\261U\030\376\324\036\177\025Q\251\343V<$5@\215\031D\246\2305o&\341;$\314\224\356x\003\251\002\245\f\ts\342\210\313\352p\226\212\310;A\370\225\242&\326\277E\363\250\024\345\230\344\252\265\226\327>s\201\237\021\244\177\255s\322,\023\210\276\251\253\345\321\b\033<4c\205 MQ\300\354vp4\341\021\231\312\336\357\a\356is\3556\032\303\316&0\231\336\340\234}u\0241\2754e\255\261,\030\v)l\370\205\263\v.\000\303\270\255\035Z\017\f$X\320Oj\245Wx&\256\376\317d\300\301\000\031\260\337"
